        "original_id": "3db8743b-b462-5688-b6cd-9f040ab96a1d",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Jared Harris, Amber Heard, Mamie Gummer, Danielle Panabaker, Laura-Leigh\n- Works: The Ward, We're the Millers, The Client List, Mad Men, Fringe, The Crown, The Expanse, In Which We Meet Mr. Jones\n- Characters: Lane Pryce, David Robert Jones, King George VI, Anderson Dawes\n- Organizations: AMC, Fox, Netflix, Syfy, FBI\n- Places: Frankfurt\n\nFacts:\n- Jared Francis Harris was born on 24 August 1961 and is an English actor.\n- The film \"The Ward\" stars Amber Heard, Mamie Gummer, Danielle Panabaker, and Jared Harris.\n- Laura-Leigh is known for roles in \"We're the Millers\" and \"The Ward\" and as a series regular in the TV series \"The Client List\".\n- Jared Harris is best known for playing Lane Pryce on AMC's drama series \"Mad Men\".\n- Jared Harris is best known for playing David Robert Jones on Fox's science-fiction series \"Fringe\".\n- In \"In Which We Meet Mr. Jones,\" Olivia meets biochemist David Robert Jones, played by Jared Harris, in Frankfurt to find a cure after an FBI agent collapses from a parasite constricting his heart.\n- Jared Harris is best known for playing King George VI in Netflix's historical series \"The Crown\".\n- Jared Harris is best known for playing Anderson Dawes on Syfy's science-fiction series \"The Expanse\".",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
